OL,3,GNEWSABandstand's delayed return a
OL,4,A'blood-boiling farce'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays to the repair and return of a
OL,7,Fpark's Grade II listed Victorian
OL,8,Fbandstand are likely to continue for at
OL,9,Fleast another year, leading a local
OL,10,Fcampaigner to dub the ongoing saga
OL,11,F"self-inflicted neglect".
OL,13,FThe structure in Roker Park,
OL,14,FSunderland, had been fenced off since
OL,15,F2021 before being dismantled last year
OL,16,Fand taken to a workshop for renovation
OL,17,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
