OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABandstand's delayed return a
OL,4,A'blood-boiling farce'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving originally been set for a return
OL,7,Fthis spring, the reopening was then put
OL,8,Fback to an unspecified date this
OL,9,Fsummer, but councillor Andrew Ramsay
OL,10,Fhas now said it will be next summer at
OL,11,Fthe earliest.
OL,13,FResident and campaigner David Laws said
OL,14,Fthe missing bandstand makes his "blood
OL,15,Fboil" and described the continuing
OL,16,Fdelays as "farcical".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
